                <p>A learning space with books and study resources.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="facility-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1498243691581-b145c3f54a5a"
                     alt="University campus">
                <h3>Smart Classrooms</h3>
                <p>Comfortable classrooms for interactive learning.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="facility-card">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523580494863-6f3031224c94"
                     alt="University students">
                <h3>Student Activities</h3>
                <p>Opportunities to participate in campus activities.</p>
            </div>

        </div>
